  "reasoning": "The defendant committed two distinct criminal acts. First, he unlawfully entered a company’s premises, used his knowledge of the company’s Alipay account to transfer funds to his own prepared account, and later returned the money, which constitutes theft (盗窃). Second, he arranged for the production of false resident identity cards, which is the crime of forging resident ID documents (伪造居民身份证件). Both offenses are clearly described in the facts and are separate crimes, so both labels should be applied, separated by a semicolon.",
